<!--
  Odia strings of the iPhone UI. values/strings.xml has the comments for each key: where the text shows,
  the placeholders and the length limits. docs/LOCALIZATION_GLOSSARY.md gives the terms and their sources.
  The polite form "ଆପଣ" with "-ନ୍ତୁ", and English loanwords where Odia iOS uses them ("ସେଭ୍", "ଡିଲୀଟ୍", "ଏଡିଟ୍").
  "ଆଟାକ୍" is the episode, and "ପୀଡ଼ା" the pain. Odia has the CLDR plural forms one and other.
  The duration chips have no unit, because "12–24 ଘଣ୍ଟା" is longer than 7 characters: the captions name the hours.
-->
